  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 dash ground nutmeg",
    "2 tablespoons melted butter",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "1 quart oil for frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Heat oil in a deep-fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h2gGf4v674h_GiusRxNTAAoyAUg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-1-7458cd9514ff43a0b847b5694aac0f0b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift together flour, sugar, baking powder, salt, cinnamon, and nutmeg in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zjGBJC1lW8wd0OFkfrTBFkmC4mE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-2-cf2787f7c5884f4a922941d4d4cf4935.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in butter until crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-inZtkUpTf2IwVd4RIphw4Q8mis=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-3-27171ba297664825a1796d573a5ffff9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in milk and egg until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gKaIg7Wf9AQOcftdiwIZVLyE9Ic=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-4-2b1cead7bcd047cb941ee5ae15f0c290.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead lightly, then turn out onto a lightly floured surface. Roll or pat to 1/4-inch thickness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5O8VZOOJQU1uSm8R-O-_h92-2ac=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-6-51832cdcf7b1454eb38c6c96b06e788e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut with a doughnut cutter, or use two round biscuit cutters of different sizes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KIlGUeJyd633bx6a0VS-buZ_jJM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-7-ca8b432aacb649e7879601a64ebad350.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay doughnuts in hot oil, a few at a time. Do not overcrowd the pan, or oil may overflow.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EZnK6wLxxit0yHhIKKHfrbzWAYA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-8-47bc0cb3c3b946c9a25668c44ccd8b9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry, turning once, until golden, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y9UlbuBY62PqNBPqk10F3RR-yFQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-9-1-ef4883152f0b43fa9b98577dc452917a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/64zV2G7MhMqhEax_Ytutxf9hlPg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-43051-plain-cake-doughnuts-DDMFS-step-11-af5d4adb8735415da575cfff02b0772b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43051/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
